Package: raye-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP key of the Raye Linux package archive
 The public key apt uses to check packages from the Raye Linux archive,
 the apt source that points to it and the list of its mirrors
 (rayelinux.com first, GitHub second).

Package: raye-release
Architecture: all
Depends: raye-archive-keyring (>= ${source:Version}), base-files, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Raye Linux release files
 Identifies the system as Raye Linux (os-release, lsb-release, issue)
 and sets up apt the Raye way: snaps are blocked, Firefox comes from
 Mozilla's own archive as a regular package, and the crash reporters
 and advertising hooks of the base system are kept out.
 .
 Raye Linux is based on Ubuntu. It is not affiliated with or endorsed
 by Canonical Ltd.

