# were removed from apps/debian/control because the packages shipped
# EMPTY (changelog.gz + copyright, 1792 bytes, Installed-Size: 9, and
# their full Depends), so uncommenting one now fails the ISO build on an
# unfindable dependency. The two groups below are kept apart for that
# reason, and iso/tools/tests/test_staged_packages.py derives both from
# apps/debian/control at run time: a name in the wrong group is red.
#
# staged-ready: apps/debian/control declares it, so the "#" may go.
