# dropping that marker AND adding its stanza AND moving its line up here,
# in the same commit. Tickets: terminal AP-2, notepad AP-10, snip AP-12
# (drop kde-spectacle above), calculator AP-19 (drop kcalc above), camera
# AP-21, photos AP-22 (drop gwenview above once AP-23 lands too),
